# Linear personal API key (https://linear.app/settings/account/security).
# When set, the "Import tickets from Linear" option is shown and saved scores
# are written back to Linear. Leave empty to turn the integration off.
# Warning: it is compiled into the JavaScript bundle, so don't set it for a public deploy
# unless you're fine with anyone who loads the site being able to read it.
LINEAR_API_KEY=
